{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a 3D multiplayer co-op game set in space. You play as robots trying to find planet Earth to be able to factory reset yourselves using a &quot;cloud&quot;. <br>Many game's challenges need to be faced having a 3P (third person) perspective of your teammates cameras making this game a 2P (second person) perspective. You need to learn how to control your character and complete levels with great teamwork and coordination. <br>The game CAN be played in a single player mode as a easy casual platformer but it is mainly set to be co-op experience. <br>You can set your difficulty by playing 2-4 player games with either set or constantly rotating cameras or spice things up with your friends in a 2v2 mode. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game also features special levels, events and mods forcing players on maximum cooperation, adaptability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862980/extras/90c403c5871f98d4201cb2162f9c12e7.poster.avif?t=1774661290\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862980/extras/90c403c5871f98d4201cb2162f9c12e7.webm?t=1774661290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862980/extras/90c403c5871f98d4201cb2162f9c12e7.mp4?t=1774661290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3862980?t=1774661290","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3862980?t=1774661290","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862980/01e26878a5976716c8f376e7bcfacc364d96d60c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774661290","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akam